# The Postman Always KO's Twice (windurst 19), completion parity: 52's finish (52 to 55 share it) is the Lua's raw
# player:completeQuest (after the trade, the gil, the fame), so a GM's Quest[2][19]Prog survives the completion
# (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) beside Ambrosius.
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=63.5,-2.5,-63.2 job=WAR lvl=75
item TornEpistle
login
quest Windurst.ThePostmanAlwaysKosTwice accepted
charvar Quest[2][19]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Ambrosius TornEpistle x1          # accepted, one: 52 (50)
finish                                  # taken; 50 gil; fame 10; completed; Prog kept
